# Development: leave unset so the Vite dev server proxies /api → http://localhost:3000
#
# Production (Safari Omni): set at **build time** on Render (Static Site) or in CI.
# Same origin (SPA + API on https://safariomni.com): leave VITE_API_URL unset — requests use relative /api.
# Split origin (API on another hostname): set the API base, no trailing slash:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.safariomni.com
